keywords": ["mindfulness", "memory", "relaxation", "wellbeing", "cognitive"], "long_description": "Il Mondo Bene Essere brings together the VR exercises created by the Bene Essere team in Rome in a single immersive island.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n- A 3D island floats in front of you: rotate it with the controller or the thumbstick and point at a place.\n- Each place opens its exercises. Before starting you see a short description and can adjust the settings (difficulty, duration, speed and more) directly in VR.\n- Each exercise runs in full immersion and brings you back to the island when you finish.\n\nWHAT YOU CAN TRAIN\n- Attention and inhibition: The Lighthouse, Whack-a-mole.\n- Working memory: Koi, feed every carp only once.\n- Episodic memory: The Witness, immersive scenes with questions at the end.\n- Divided attention: The Market and Airport Sorting.\n- Cognitive flexibility: Katana, cut the fruit in the direction shown by the legend.\n- Calm and breathing: Aether and Constellations.\n- Duel: short challenges to play with a friend.\n\nThe interface is in Italian. No account is needed and no personal data is collected.\n\nBene Essere is a gentle daily training for wellbeing. It is not a medical device and does not provide diagnosis or treatment.", "short_description": "A VR island of mind-training exercises. Turn the 3D island, pick a place, choose an exercise and set its level and duration right in VR. Train attention, memory, planning and calm in immersive scenes: sort luggage at the airport, feed koi carp, cut fruit with a katana, watch from a lighthouse. Interface in Italian."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beneesseremondoprivacy.netlify.app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bene Essere", "support_website_url": "https://beneesseremondoprivacy.netlify.app/", "website_url": "https://mondobe.netlify.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_catego